# Meta Pixel ID — when set, the pixel script loads on every page,
# fires PageView on each route change, and CompleteRegistration after signup.
# Without this var, no Pixel script is loaded.
#
# Usage:
#   1. Copy this file to .env.production (or .env.local for dev)
#   2. Replace the value with your real Pixel ID from Meta Events Manager
#   3. Rebuild: npm run build
VITE_META_PIXEL_ID=
